            <div xml:id="m-2b03a5d6-1020-413f-9954-02b1c1f93036">
              <lg xml:id="m-bcd7b2f9-7401-415f-b103-b291b4cee288">
                <l xml:id="m-df7063e6-b555-410f-a4a1-a298fc78d242" facs="#m-c9a72e1c-1366-40ab-9bc0-8f78659c458a" label="ambiguous">Thursday in Easter Week.</l><l xml:id="m-8c9d351c-e1dd-4183-9264-ac826a94c6dc" facs="#m-c7a93c04-5331-45ea-b497-a0f4ae19f465" label="ambiguous">708</l><l xml:id="m-17732bde-0448-4b58-b17f-b83706dac034" facs="#m-bdebbde5-be67-4e8d-afe1-e35ba4adfca6" label="lyrics-like">a Dó-mi-no</l><l xml:id="m-b04029bc-258a-4830-bc93-d0a07a836fe2" facs="#m-c9182f39-8127-4454-9a1e-2f3e47e567ec" label="ambiguous">put</l><l xml:id="m-d3cbde44-66a3-4204-9ee6-8bb5f13b3705" facs="#m-6fd16c88-91df-4e7f-873c-8aa25be42000" label="lyrics-like">án¬</l><l xml:id="m-a985198b-bd57-4fed-a02a-af8e5309203c" facs="#m-9afaae03-34c5-432f-a6bb-141659e9b7cb" label="ambiguous">gu- li:</l><l xml:id="m-87dd6572-6501-4ebb-96ca-9d6b9633ef4a" facs="#m-39d134d6-1c30-45a4-aebf-17c3fcc74a9a" label="ambiguous">bi-le</l><l xml:id="m-c67f8176-05e7-4b0a-a3f3-5b068db14db0" facs="#m-520eb89e-c5ca-48c3-b5bd-75d5978201d3" label="ambiguous">in</l><l xml:id="m-5a7f4ff4-9445-4138-8bc3-2a43a6ecafe0" facs="#m-db5ccf77-3f82-41d6-81ff-0ffd4f3e51b6" label="lyrics-like">fá- ctum est,</l><l xml:id="m-2ff5bcdf-aad5-4020-8ed3-2061865055e0" facs="#m-3f9ae33f-878c-469a-8130-d89599033a4e" label="lyrics-like">et est mi¬ rá¬</l><l xml:id="m-de1fbb87-acf5-46cd-b760-94f858784fe8" facs="#m-c34368e5-a9ce-42bd-a063-1d92ca0f3bbb" label="lyrics-like">6́- cu-lis “ nó-stris.</l><l xml:id="m-115a51a8-980c-4ada-8521-3d2ac6ef14a0" facs="#m-c8e991f5-cbce-4079-aa2b-86e2a6123326" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-dbf4dede-b1af-4a80-8471-23a16fecfb23" facs="#m-e90bf378-fee7-4f29-a56a-3c852b15f531" label="ambiguous">A "</l><l xml:id="m-24fc9cc7-e6b8-4df2-afd0-fc0bdebcda23" facs="#m-ceeb37ab-9167-4abe-a1ca-69bb7df5093e" label="lyrics-like">lú¬ ia. "ij.</l><l xml:id="m-5919edaa-5b65-456f-8567-72b736fc7ac2" facs="#m-37227c95-7385-4e19-89cd-ae0fa0226f25" label="lyrics-like">V. Surréxit</l><l xml:id="m-e3575dd0-021c-407a-8ff7-59618af02487" facs="#m-a670a1ad-6da2-42ed-85df-a0b8b1032eeb" label="lyrics-like">Chrístus, qui cre-ávit ómni¬</l><l xml:id="m-cd74bde1-eddc-4e81-95e3-388718b28488" facs="#m-c925da68-f95c-47ab-b163-e406e8896b1f" label="lyrics-like">et mi-sértus</l><l xml:id="m-f97c9fe7-66ba-4429-86bc-46ee54a27464" facs="#m-9d6cac9a-6d4c-4d8f-972e-efbf9e51fab0" label="lyrics-like">est hu- máno “géne-ri.</l><l xml:id="m-0e6b80d8-20d7-4ed2-be9a-d05a0c6a7a1a" facs="#m-84386b07-03a6-4c26-89e0-fc1db16111d8" label="lyrics-like">Sequence. Victimae Pascháli. with Allelúia at the end, p. 780.</l><l xml:id="m-b4e59ba5-bff4-45d1-bf4d-6c8c1198cea1" facs="#m-840b431d-add1-454b-aa06-4050896ae434" label="ambiguous">1 Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. Joann. 20. c.</l><l xml:id="m-424ca02d-5b03-46b4-8fd2-7ad1f8aafb50" facs="#m-aa9bc874-c6a7-4424-b3e3-4efe97718b35" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Maria stabat ad ] hortulánus esset, dicit ei: Dómine,</l><l xml:id="m-e8d10b90-20ff-44c2-866e-943822c5afd4" facs="#m-02cc9136-f80a-470b-9cbe-6ba5538160cd" label="lyrics-like">L monuméntum foris. plorans.</l><l xml:id="m-1976259f-ca65-4297-8482-8cc39716651d" facs="#m-046b5476-9ec7-4210-aecd-37836208ed66" label="lyrics-like">si tu sustulísti eum, dicito mihi ubi</l><l xml:id="m-133a5fe1-3e6c-46b8-b99b-a24efce20ed2" facs="#m-e2e9b459-ea64-4802-a03d-56bc8be15e87" label="lyrics-like">Dum ergo fleret, inclinávit se, et</l><l xml:id="m-4a999228-6957-4dc9-afce-156053c55129" facs="#m-06038c3b-ae5d-47c4-b106-00ccf516b516" label="ambiguous">posuisti eum: et ego eum tollam.</l><l xml:id="m-27879126-157a-4ea1-a444-071bbfe21565" facs="#m-34e73e0c-a76a-4db1-ad4f-a3ee876cb7b0" label="lyrics-like">prospéxit in monuméntum: et vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-4e439aed-004d-49b8-b052-e2cee5a1cec2" facs="#m-e5419aa6-5e1c-4263-8a85-694a960dcc04" label="lyrics-like">Dicit ei Jesus: Maria. Convérsa</l><l xml:id="m-241666be-facb-4aea-b174-f60f16e36f5e" facs="#m-cbd9ae26-5b86-4eb5-be68-dee4b7db2b9f" label="lyrics-like">dit duos Angelos in albis, sedéntes,</l><l xml:id="m-2f7daeb7-21cf-4804-bd12-803300f3c2cd" facs="#m-16dd899f-4134-4095-b381-c3b8eee24e54" label="lyrics-like">illa, dicit ei : Rabbóni (quod dicitur</l><l xml:id="m-90108cda-6661-43ab-9334-0ab2cfceca45" facs="#m-c43b0c53-a29a-4f99-a110-7b6c9e8f302d" label="ambiguous">Magister). Dicit ei Jesus: Noli me</l><l xml:id="m-5ea8ed6c-2096-444e-8026-5dd121c50f6a" facs="#m-bad1f2c1-7c76-4e2a-bf7f-3ba9558da447" label="ambiguous">unum ad caput, et unum ad pedes,</l><l xml:id="m-d17ad15e-78a5-403a-a0e7-c06e2d7786ef" facs="#m-ffa663bf-a84d-478e-9387-2d8343e84d17" label="lyrics-like">ubi pósitum fúerat corpus Jesu¬</l><l xml:id="m-24bbc579-d058-4a19-a51e-eb2e59af5ea3" facs="#m-db32186a-c6b5-4318-9d4e-9275ffb7cf64" label="lyrics-like">tángere, nondum enim ascéndi ad</l><l xml:id="m-834da091-97af-4574-80d7-0526588f6fe9" facs="#m-89a94977-c36e-4a53-a496-120076dc03ce" label="lyrics-like">Dicunt ei illi : Múlier, quid ploras?</l><l xml:id="m-fdb2b9ac-5ab4-45e3-be4e-6afb9adb4a2b" facs="#m-49d67bec-22d6-4314-a4ef-17df9a020271" label="ambiguous">Patrem meum: vade autem ad</l><l xml:id="m-e8ecb1cc-6e80-475f-9db1-359ca110f706" facs="#m-9597cc2a-defd-4e6c-bd7a-90c4b1df2f09" label="lyrics-like">Dicit eis: Quia tulérunt Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-3ed8d821-3ad7-43f5-81f7-532cedfe0ebc" facs="#m-2e1f8cde-5eb1-404b-9029-698485c2d207" label="lyrics-like">fratres meos, et dic eis: Ascéndo</l><l xml:id="m-36d2800d-43d2-4d5c-bccd-cbb28b5545a6" facs="#m-9548df1f-7125-4c45-9837-83551aeaf44c" label="ambiguous">ad Patrem meum, et Patrem ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-cfaae72f-3d10-40fd-9575-fbf2b8f16925" facs="#m-8cd6c1f7-a165-4e57-929f-44bebbfdfb42" label="lyrics-like">meum: et néscio ubi posuérunt</l><l xml:id="m-8f8b2188-a3ee-429c-af6f-df0dedb1004f" facs="#m-e3fdf77d-38d0-4b86-907b-7d159dbe498c" label="lyrics-like">eum. Haec cum dixisset, convérsa</l><l xml:id="m-efb0d821-c3ae-4d42-a5b5-ed51b6529cbc" facs="#m-6e3a9d22-05cc-443e-9571-39f5c2a5ef76" label="ambiguous">strum, Deum meum, et Deum</l><l xml:id="m-2287b4bc-ed73-4a68-bdb3-cbe6ab0fe723" facs="#m-52523ce3-fe4e-48d3-96b0-3a8ed973afbf" label="lyrics-like">est retrórsum, et vidit Jesum stan¬</l><l xml:id="m-bbe8cd88-b36e-4909-bae5-db4b9d26d712" facs="#m-99e95a19-e87d-45e8-a5cf-2427b6598037" label="lyrics-like">vestrum. Venit Maria Magdaléne</l><l xml:id="m-41cd1404-f9b5-4a72-8eee-374e97d731a7" facs="#m-a9f32b79-8989-4fe6-b841-2870eabdbd69" label="lyrics-like">annúntians discipulis: Quia vidi</l><l xml:id="m-95f52226-7a9c-4143-8c56-86327d0b7903" facs="#m-2bb10d94-ffe8-44fe-a216-cf230465fc63" label="lyrics-like">tem: et non sciébat quia Jesus est.</l><l xml:id="m-fb3a9abe-409d-4f76-b602-eeba5fbb031c" facs="#m-703fa0dc-f591-48d5-8555-c16acd11c564" label="lyrics-like">Dicit ei Jesus : Múlier, quid ploras?</l><l xml:id="m-7050c97e-a9fc-4771-ae52-c649ce7cc8a5" facs="#m-00d846dd-15f3-49fc-9556-c457b499f768" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum, et haec dixit mihi.</l><l xml:id="m-2b10bd7e-4231-4e93-b9a5-8b349fd6d838" facs="#m-1f7d4b7c-06f6-4efd-9750-3e00ff77645e" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-1b867a21-d8d3-48cb-9e40-13db21c10e52" facs="#m-e6ea5c46-2679-4d1f-9333-8812c1db705f" label="lyrics-like">quem quaeris? Illa exístimans quia</l><l xml:id="m-c2b2e5df-8bc1-4072-8c4d-2e1add54d504" facs="#m-dbb2bb1a-3b6c-46b9-b0b2-60575f5bc300" label="ambiguous">orert.!</l><l xml:id="m-a57da86c-6b37-47a8-a8c6-df5c469eb5f1" facs="#m-1270c88a-526b-4fb0-921f-79c5cf7e2d23" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-de4830af-96f3-4ac2-86f5-6d21e37f46d4" facs="#m-8678b588-ba9a-46db-9bd3-d524ce1f1de7" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-e9b47d21-bb3c-40c3-b379-9c8e1c0b97e2" facs="#m-373a6aee-4388-42e6-8428-af9de569e3a4" label="ambiguous">N di¬</l><l xml:id="m-097efe6a-96c9-44bc-b205-3ea38cc16544" facs="#m-af227991-707b-4606-94b9-257eb64fa3a1" label="lyrics-like">sol-emni-tá- tis vé- strae,</l><l xml:id="m-64763476-4224-46a8-a2e8-7bae8a6ffc4f" facs="#m-07a2ad41-ecda-4723-bb46-6c7c61e8faed" label="ambiguous">6</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>